#!/usr/bin/env python3

"""gra - Git Repo Admin

A tiny worktree-first clone helper that puts repositories under a flat ~/gra
layout. Each repository lives in a bare checkout, and work happens in
short-named worktrees next to it:

    ~/gra/<repo>/.bare
    ~/gra/<repo>/<name>

Worktree names are word pairs like warmhare derived from the repository - the
same on every machine - unique across all repositories, and unrelated to the
branch they have checked out: switch branches freely inside a worktree, or
start a new one and remove it when done.
"""

